evidence = "The final hf-done JSON and private evidence ledger name the exact verified content-derived candidate revision, command, exit code and log path. Build and verification must pass on the same candidate revision. The record is finalized before qualification because embedding its own candidate hash would change that hash. The runner retains evidence and publishes the result; no manual commit or push is performed."
